---
// CTA final de AstroCarlZ
---

<section class="relative py-28 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  {/* Gradiente de fondo */}
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-marina to-marina-dark"></div>

  {/* Círculos decorativos */}
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[400px] h-[400px] md:w-[550px] md:h-[550px] rounded-full border border-dorado/20 pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[240px] h-[240px] md:w-[320px] md:h-[320px] rounded-full border border-dorado/30 pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[80px] h-[80px] md:w-[110px] md:h-[110px] rounded-full border border-dorado/40 pointer-events-none"></div>
 
  {/* Contenido */}
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    {/* Eyebrow */}
    <p class="font-sans text-xs tracking-wide-elegant text-dorado/80 uppercase mb-8">
      Da el primer paso
    </p>

    {/* Título */}
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl text-dorado tracking-elegant leading-tight mb-8">
      ¿Listo para leer<br class="hidden md:block" /> tu cielo?
    </h2>

    {/* Divider decorativo */}
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-10">
      <div class="w-16 h-px bg-dorado/50"></div>
      <div class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-dorado"></div>
      <div class="w-16 h-px bg-dorado/50"></div>
    </div>

    {/* Descripción */}
    <p class="font-sans text-base md:text-lg text-crema/70 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed">
      Escríbenos por WhatsApp y te ayudamos a elegir la lectura que mejor se
      adapte a lo que estás viviendo.
    </p>

    {/* CTA principal */}
    <a
      href="https://wa.me/526861614063?text=Hola%20AstroCarlZ%2C%20quiero%20agendar%20una%20consulta."
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="inline-block px-10 py-5 bg-dorado text-marina font-sans text-sm tracking-wide-elegant uppercase font-medium hover:bg-dorado-light transition-colors duration-300 shadow-lg shadow-dorado/20"
    >
      Agendar por WhatsApp
    </a>

  </div>
</section>